goodsAndServices:
IC 040: Production in the nature of custom manufacture of footwear, clothing and bags to order and according to customer specifications;
customised manufacture of footwear and clothing; material treatment by means of chemical treatment and processing of plastics
and fabrics for the manufacture of footwear, clothing and bags; molding of plastic materials; processing of plastics; material
treatment and processing of plastics, fabrics, footwear and clothing for recycling purposes; recycling of plastics, fabrics, footwear
and clothing to obtain materials for the production of synthetic fibres; material treatment in connection with recycling; recycling;
waste recycling; recycling as compensation for CO2 emissions.
